<view class="page" wx:if="{{settings}}">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="row">
      <text class="card-title" style="margin-bottom: 0;">每日目标</text>
      <text class="value">{{settings.goal}} mL</text>
    </view>
    <slider
      class="slider"
      min="500"
      max="5000"
      step="100"
      value="{{settings.goal}}"
      activeColor="#2f80ed"
      block-size="22"
      bindchange="onGoalChange"
    />
    <view class="presets">
      <view class="preset" data-goal="1500" bindtap="onGoalPreset">1500</view>
      <view class="preset" data-goal="2000" bindtap="onGoalPreset">2000</view>
      <view class="preset" data-goal="2500" bindtap="onGoalPreset">2500</view>
      <view class="preset" data-goal="3000" bindtap="onGoalPreset">3000</view>
    </view>
    <text class="muted">一般建议每天 1500 - 2500 mL，运动量大或天气炎热可适当增加。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">快捷杯量 (mL)</view>
    <view class="cup-inputs">
      <input
        class="cup-input"
        wx:for="{{settings.cups}}"
        wx:key="index"
        type="number"
        value="{{item}}"
        data-index="{{index}}"
        bindblur="onCupInput"
      />
    </view>
    <text class="muted">首页「快速记录」按钮的水量，修改后立即生效。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">提醒</view>

    <view class="item">
      <text class="item-label">开启提醒</text>
      <switch checked="{{settings.remindEnabled}}" color="#2f80ed" bindchange="onRemindToggle" />
    </view>

    <picker mode="time" value="{{settings.startTime}}" bindchange="onStartTimeChange">
      <view class="item">
        <text class="item-label">开始时间</text>
        <text class="value">{{settings.startTime}} ›</text>
      </view>
    </picker>

    <picker mode="time" value="{{settings.endTime}}" bindchange="onEndTimeChange">
      <view class="item">
        <text class="item-label">结束时间</text>
        <text class="value">{{settings.endTime}} ›</text>
      </view>
    </picker>

    <picker mode="selector" range="{{intervalOptions}}" value="{{intervalIndex}}" bindchange="onIntervalChange">
      <view class="item">
        <text class="item-label">提醒间隔</text>
        <text class="value">{{intervalOptions[intervalIndex]}} ›</text>
      </view>
    </picker>

    <view class="item">
      <text class="item-label">提醒时震动</text>
      <switch checked="{{settings.vibrate}}" color="#2f80ed" bindchange="onVibrateToggle" />
    </view>

    <view class="item last">
      <text class="item-label">下次提醒</text>
      <text class="muted">{{nextText}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="action" bindtap="onSubscribe">开启微信推送提醒</view>
    <text class="muted">小程序退到后台后定时器会暂停，授权订阅消息后才能在关闭小程序时收到提醒。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">数据</view>
    <view class="item" bindtap="onResetSettings">
      <text class="item-label">恢复默认设置</text>
      <text class="value">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="item last" bindtap="onClearRecords">
      <text class="item-label danger">清空饮水记录</text>
      <text class="value">›</text>
    </view>
    <text class="muted">所有数据仅保存在本机，不会上传。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="footer">喝水提醒 v{{version}}</view>
</view>
